# .vercelignore — what the deployment does not need.
#
# The site is frontend/ behind the rewrites in vercel.json plus the
# functions in api/. Everything else in the repository is build tooling,
# database work or documentation, and without this file it was served as
# static files too: /scripts/refresh.mjs, /sql/01_create_schema.sql,
# /docs/DATA_POLICY.md and a skill file all answered 200 on 2026-09-11.
# Nothing there was secret, but a raw data download committed under
# data-sources/ would have been public the moment it was pushed.
#
# What stays, and why:
#   api/           the functions, and api/package.json for "type": "module"
#   vercel.json    the rewrites
#   frontend/      the pages, lib/ and data/. api/statements.js requires
#                  ../frontend/lib/ratios.js and scripts/lib/sec-pull.mjs
#                  requires frontend/lib/metrics.js. Its three tooling
#                  files (the dev server, the Power BI export script and
#                  their package.json) are excluded below; nothing in the
#                  build reads a package.json outside the root.
#   scripts/lib/   every function imports ../scripts/lib/*.mjs. An ignored
#                  file is not uploaded at all, so ignoring this directory
#                  would break every function at runtime. It is served as
#                  static files on purpose: the libraries read their
#                  contact address and keys from the environment and hold
#                  no secret. Only the top-level scripts and the test
#                  fixtures are excluded.
#
# Same syntax as .gitignore. Explicit lines rather than a "/*" allowlist
# with negations, so the list reads as what is excluded and why.
# scripts/check-exposure.mjs probes the live site for the result: the
# weekly refresh runs it after its push, and it can be run by hand
# against a preview.

# tooling, CI and the house rules: every dot-directory and dot-file
.*/
.gitignore
.vercelignore

# the weekly refresh and the builders run in Actions, never on the site
scripts/*.mjs
scripts/fixtures/

# frontend/ tooling that is not page content
frontend/dev-server.js
frontend/export_dashboard_data.py
frontend/package.json

# the MySQL and Power BI leg
sql/
loaders/
PowerBI_Dashboard_Project.*
Debtsheet - KBLB.xlsm

# documentation and design notes
docs/
design-plans/
/*.md

# raw PitchBook and LCD downloads (gitignored on the owner's machine, but
# listed here so a committed copy is never served)
data-sources/
